  "description": "The Premium Broadway sits at the top of our complete bike line up. As close to a pro level bike as you can get without breaking the bank, the Broadway features a stacked list of quality parts that compromise nothing. Starting with full chromoly frame, fork and handlebar as our material of choice, this bike is built to last and blast! Bolted to those tasty bits is our Premium Samsara rims laced to sealed bearing hubs with a freecoaster out back and wrapped in some sticky 2.4\" Premium CK tires. The 9.25\" bars attach to a top-load stem and spin with ease with the help of the Premium sealed bearing integrated headset.\nFull CR-MO frame with integrated head tube, Mid BB shell, removable brake mounts.\nFull CR-MO fork with internal threaded steer tube and tapered legs.\nFull CR-MO 9\" bars & Premium top load stem.\nPremium Team Grips flangeless\nThree-piece crmo 175mm 8-spline cranks with sealed Mid BB\n28/9 gearing with alloy sprocket\nFully sealed wheels with Samsara double-wall rims and free-coaster rear hub\nPremium CK tires 2.4\" front and rear\nPremium Fat Capitol Pivotal seat with alloy Pivotal post\nPremium Kinetic plastic pedals",
